  "description": "This package is part of the Nano Library, a set of reusable .NET libraries for building microservice applications. Nano addresses common non-business concerns such as logging, persistence, messaging, validation, and documentation, while remaining fully configurable and extensible, so applications can stay focused on business logic. See https://github.com/Nano-Core/Nano.Library for details.",
